---
title: Umbra Frontend Component Tree
---
flowchart TD
  MAIN["Application Entry Point\nmain.jsx\nBoots React and wires up the router"]
  APP["Root Shell\nApp.jsx\nManages dark and light theme preference\nPersists choice in browser storage"]
  AUTHP["Authentication Provider\nTracks the signed-in user across the whole app\nRestores session on page refresh\nProvides login and logout actions to all child components"]
  HDR["Navigation Bar\nHeader\nLinks to every section · theme toggle · sign-out button"]
  RTR["Page Router\nMaps URL paths to page components\nHandles all client-side navigation"]

  LGN["Sign-In Page\n/login\nUsername and password form\nRedirects to dashboard on success"]
  PR["Route Guard\nProtectedRoute\nBlocks access to all pages unless signed in\nShows a loading spinner while checking session\nSends unauthenticated users to the sign-in page"]

  DASH["Dashboard\n/\nAggregated overview of your todo activity:\ntotal items, overdue count, importance breakdown,\nmost active lists and tags"]
  LISTSPAGE["Lists Page\n/lists\nBrowse all your todo lists\nCreate, rename, recolor, and delete lists"]
  LISTDET["List Detail Page\n/lists/:id\nView and manage all items in a single list\nCreate, edit, reorder, complete, and export tasks"]
  TAGSPAGE["Tags Page\n/tags\nCreate and manage tag labels with colors\nUsed to categorise tasks across all lists"]
  COLSPAGE["Colors Page\n/colors\nManage the shared color palette\nNamed colors are used by lists and tags throughout the app"]

  LG["Lists Grid\nResponsive card grid showing all lists"]
  LC["List Card\nShows list name, description, item count, and color swatch\nEdit and delete buttons"]
  LF["List Form\nCreate or update a list\nEnter a name, description, and choose a color\nDisplayed inside a modal overlay"]

  IL["Item List\nDraggable list of tasks\nSupports live drag-and-drop reordering\nChanges are saved automatically on drop"]
  IR["Item Row\nA single task in the list\nClick the title to edit it inline\nShows due date, importance, and applied tags"]
  ICHK["Completion Checkbox\nCircular checkbox\nMarks a task complete or incomplete with one click"]
  DH["Drag Handle\nGrip icon on each row\nDrag to manually reorder tasks within the list"]
  IFM["Item Form\nCreate or update a task\nTitle, description, due date, estimated duration,\npriority importance level, and tag selection\nDisplayed inside a modal overlay"]

  BADGE["Tag Badge\nSmall coloured chip showing a tag name\nColour comes from the tag's assigned Color"]
  TSEL["Tag Selector\nMulti-select tag picker\nUsed inside the item form to assign tags to a task"]
  CSWATCH["Color Swatch\nSmall filled circle showing a hex color\nUsed in list cards, tag rows, and the color picker"]
  CPICK["Color Picker\nScrollable grid of color swatches\nClick to select a color for a list or tag"]
  MODAL["Modal Overlay\nFull-screen backdrop with centred content\nDismissed by pressing Escape or clicking outside"]
  SPIN["Loading Spinner\nShown while data loads or session is being verified"]
  ERR["Error Message\nDisplays a human-readable API or network error"]

  MAIN --> APP --> AUTHP
  AUTHP --> HDR & RTR
  RTR --> LGN & PR
  PR --> DASH & LISTSPAGE & LISTDET & TAGSPAGE & COLSPAGE

  LISTSPAGE --> LG & LF
  LG --> LC
  LC --> CSWATCH
  LF --> CPICK & MODAL

  LISTDET --> IL & IFM
  IL --> IR
  IR --> ICHK & DH & BADGE
  IFM --> TSEL & MODAL

  TAGSPAGE --> BADGE & TSEL & CPICK & MODAL
  COLSPAGE --> CSWATCH & CPICK & MODAL

  AUTHP -.-> SPIN
  PR -.-> SPIN
  LISTSPAGE -.-> ERR
  LISTDET -.-> ERR
  TAGSPAGE -.-> ERR
  COLSPAGE -.-> ERR
